    {
      "name": "Broken Magic",
      "type": "feature",
      "system": {
        "featureForm": "action",
        "description": "<p><strong>Mark a Stress</strong> to roll a <strong>[[/r d6]]</strong>. The Mage uses the corresponding move:</p><ul><li><p>1–2: Dimension Rift. Choose a target within Far range. The target teleports to a point you choose within Close range of their original position and takes <strong>2d6</strong> direct magic damage as their body and mind reassemble.</p></li><li><p>3–4: Time Dilation. Choose a group of PCs within Far range. Each target is Slowed until they roll with Hope. While Slowed, a target is <em>Vulnerable</em> and must mark a Stress when they move.</p></li><li><p>5–6: Discordant Visions. Make an attack against up to three targets within Close range. Targets the Mage succeeds against take <strong>2d8</strong> direct magic damage.</p></li></ul>",
        "attribution": {},
